{"find": "[[page ?]]\n\n89\n\nCHAPTER V. HA, HA, THE WOOING O°D.\n\nSigh no more, ladies, sigh no more, Men were deceivers ever, One foot in sea and one on shore, To one thing constant never; Then sigh not so, but let them go, And be you blithe and bonny. Much Ado about Nothing. Mrs. TrewHetta waxed", "replace": "[[page 89]]\n\n# Chapter V.\n\n[[subtitle]] Ha, Ha, the Wooing o’t.\n\n<verse>\nSigh no more, ladies, sigh no more,\nMen were deceivers ever,\nOne foot in sea and one on shore,\nTo one thing constant never;\nThen sigh not so, but let them go,\nAnd be you blithe and bonny.\n</verse>\n[[right]] <i>Much Ado about Nothing.</i>\n\nM<sc>rs.</sc> T<sc>rewhella</sc> waxed"}
